ice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"说起来，您旁边这位是——","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1721210006:1":{"key":"say:7:1721210006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1721210006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"——艾雅在上，竟然是大魔法师梅林阁下！王后竟然请您亲自...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1721210007:1":{"key":"say:8:1721210007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1721210007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"可见王后对我的霓光鲤是多么的重视！它正是拯救国王陛下的...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1721210008:1":{"key":"say:9:1721210008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1721210008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"那么，在正式取鱼之前，就由我葛朗台，为诸位详细介绍一下——","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1721210009:1":{"key":"say:10:1721210009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1721210009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"——葛朗台男爵，我与梅林阁下都不是闲人。取完鱼后，我们...","textdes_i